  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (10)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (10) is a tiny, thin-flat gasket situated at the
    bottom-center-front, made of Material.001, similar to Oil Pan Gasket (7). It
    plays a vital role in sealing the oil pan, working in conjunction with other
    gaskets to prevent oil leaks. What's notable about this gasket is its compatibility
    with the engine's oil pan material, ensuring a durable and long-lasting seal.
